---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';

const pageHeader = "<meta http-equiv=\"x-ua-compatible\" content=\"ie=edge\">\n<title>Continex Global - Business Finance & Consulting HTML Template</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"\">";
const pageContent = "<main>\r\n\r\n\r\n         <!-- breadcrumb area start -->\r\n         <div class=\"tp-breadcrumb-ptb pt-90 pb-70 z-index-1\">\r\n            <div class=\"tp-cc-chose-bg\">\r\n               <img src=\"/assets/img/breadcrumb/image-1.jpg\" alt=\"\">\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"container\">\r\n               <div class=\"row\">\r\n                  <div class=\"col-lg-5\">\r\n                     <div class=\"tp-breadcrumb-content p-relative\">\r\n                        <ul class=\"tp-breadcrumb-list\">\r\n                           <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\r\n                           <li>></li>\r\n                           <li>Case studies Details</li>\r\n                        </ul>\r\n                        <h2 class=\"tp-breadcrumb-title\">Case studies Details</h2>\r\n                        <p>Change your life while changing the lives of others Want to do work that matters, <br> alongside people who care about impact and integrity? </p>\r\n                     </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n               </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n         </div>\r\n         <!-- breadcrumb area end -->\r\n\r\n\r\n         <!-- case-studies-details area start -->\r\n         <div class=\"tp-case-studies-details-ptb tp-sec-ptb pt-135 pb-110\">\r\n            <div class=\"container\">\r\n               <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n                  <div class=\"col-lg-8\">\r\n                     <div class=\"tp-case-studies-details-ii-wrap mb-50\">\r\n                        <div class=\"row\">\r\n                           <div class=\"col-xl-4\">\r\n                              <div class=\"tp-case-studies-details-ii-left mb-30\">\r\n                                 <div class=\"tp-case-studies-details-ii-text mb-30 pl-20\">\r\n                                    <p>Working alongside Execor, AGCO <br>\r\n                                       enhanced its decarbonization strategy <br>\r\n                                       by digitizing cost curve analysis with <br>\r\n                                       Catalyst Zero.</p>\r\n                                 </div>\r\n                                 <div class=\"tp-case-studies-details-ii-item\" data-bg-color=\"#CEF79E\">\r\n                                    <h3><span class=\"purecounter\" data-purecounter-duration=\"2\" data-purecounter-end=\"90\"></span>%</h3>\r\n                                    <p>Accelerated business growth by <br>\r\n                                       150% in 18 months with our <br>\r\n                                       precision-built strategy</p>\r\n                                    <div class=\"tp-case-studies-details-ii-dvdr\"></div>\r\n                                    <h3><span class=\"purecounter\" data-purecounter-duration=\"3\" data-purecounter-end=\"180\"></span>K</h3>\r\n                                    <p>Core data within Catalyst Zero’s IP.</p>\r\n                                 </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                           </div>\r\n                           <div class=\"col-xl-8\">\r\n                              <div class=\"tp-case-studies-details-ii-right mb-30\">\r\n                                 <div class=\"tp-case-studies-details-ii-thumb\">\r\n                                    <img class=\"radius-6 w-100\" src=\"/assets/img/finance/case/details/thumb-1.jpg\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                 </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                           </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                     </div>\r\n                     <div class=\"tp-case-studies-details-value-wrap\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tp-case-studies-details-value-item mb-70\">\r\n                           <h3 class=\"tp-case-studies-details-value-title\">The value creation opportunity</h3>\r\n                           <p>As a global leader in agricultural equipment and precision ag innovation, AGCO Corporation operates an extensive manufacturing footprint across Europe, Asia, South America, and the United States. Through flagship brands such as Fendt, Massey Ferguson, and Valtra, AGCO empowers farmers with intelligent, future-ready solutions. With sustainability at the core of its strategy, AGCO has pledged to cut Scope 1 and 2 emissions by 55% by 2033 and drive a 90% reduction by 2050—redefining the future of responsible farming.</p>\r\n                           <p>\r\n                              AGCO Corporation stands as a global powerhouse in the design, production, and distribution of advanced agricultural machinery and precision farming technologies. With manufacturing operations spanning Europe, Asia, South America, and the United States, the company delivers cutting-edge solutions through its respected brands including Fendt, Massey Ferguson, and Valtra.\r\n                           </p>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tp-case-studies-details-value-review d-flex align-items-center gap-4 mb-70\">\r\n                           <img src=\"/assets/img/finance/case/details/author-img.jpg\" alt=\"\">\r\n                           <p class=\"m-0\">\r\n                              “The future of climate action depends heavily on transforming agriculture,” Batkin explains. “Our commitment is to equip farmers with smart, low-carbon solutions that not only enhance productivity but also accelerate the transition toward sustainable farming worldwide.”\r\n                           </p>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tp-case-studies-details-value-item mb-70\">\r\n                           <h3 class=\"tp-case-studies-details-value-title\">The transformation strategy</h3>\r\n                           <p>To accelerate its decarbonization journey and overcome fragmented data challenges, Catalyst Zero collaborated with Amazon Web Services\r\n                           (AWS), AGCO’s trusted cloud partner. Working alongside Continex Global, the team implemented Catalyst Zero’s advanced Marginal Abatement\r\n                           Cost Curve (MACC) capability—purpose-built to manage complex, inconsistent, and unstructured emissions data at scale.</p>\r\n                           <p>\r\n                           Powered by machine learning, AI, and advanced analytics, the platform dramatically cuts the time and cost required to develop or refresh\r\n                           MACCs—by up to 90%. It seamlessly processes more than 300,000 emissions data points across multiple ERP systems, significantly\r\n                           minimizing manual intervention while enhancing accuracy and speed.\r\n                           </p>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tp-case-studies-details-value-item mb-30\">\r\n                           <h3 class=\"tp-case-studies-details-value-title\">The transformation impact</h3>\r\n                           <p>AGCO’s integration of Catalyst Zero is not only improving the precision of its emissions baselining and decarbonization analytics—it’s also\r\n                           accelerating the entire process. Tasks that previously required eight weeks are now completed in just one, delivering faster, data-driven\r\n                           insights that directly inform strategic action. Beyond boosting operational efficiency and sustainability reporting, the platform is enhancing\r\n                           decision-making across the enterprise.\r\n                           </p>\r\n                           <p>By providing a clear view of decarbonization opportunities across business units and regions, AGCO is able to pursue its climate objectives\r\n                           more cost-effectively. Early analysis indicates the potential for a 10% reduction in costs associated with achieving its emissions targets.\r\n                           The partnership with Continex Global and Amazon Web Services further strengthens AGCO’s sustainability capabilities through targeted training\r\n                           for key teams, including purchasing, product engineering, and IT. Simultaneously, AGCO is advancing high-impact initiatives\r\n                           such as electrifying its tractor lineup and deploying technology-driven solutions to minimize Scope 3 emissions across its supply chain.\r\n                           </p>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                     </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n               </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n         </div>\r\n         <!-- case-studies-details area end -->\r\n         \r\n\r\n         <!-- project area start -->\r\n            <div class=\"tp-cc-project-ptb tp-sec-ptb pt-130 pb-130\" data-bg-color=\"#F7F7F5\">\r\n            <div class=\"container\">\r\n               <div class=\"row align-items-end\">\r\n                  <div class=\"col-lg-12\">\r\n                     <div class=\"tp-cc-project-heading mb-60\">\r\n                        <span class=\"tp-section-sub\">Related case studies</span>\r\n                        <h3 class=\"tp-section-title corporate-color\">Cross-industry intelligence built to <br> solve the toughest challenges.</h3>\r\n                     </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n               </div>\r\n               <div class=\"row\">\r\n                  <div class=\"col-lg-12\">\r\n                     <div class=\"tp-cc-project-slider\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tp-cc-project-active swiper\">\r\n                           <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\r\n                              <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\r\n                                 <div class=\"tp-cc-project-item p-relative\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"tp-cc-project-item-thumb\">\r\n                                       <img class=\"radius-6\" src=\"/assets/img/corporate/project/thumb-1.jpg\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"tp-cc-project-item-box\">\r\n                                       <div class=\"tp-cc-project-item-content\">\r\n                                          <h3 class=\"tp-cc-project-item-title\">\r\n                                             <a href=\"#\">Integrated innovations</a>\r\n                                          </h3>\r\n                                          <p>Usability refers to the measurement of how easily br\r\n                                          and efficiently a user can accomplish their</p>\r\n                                          <div class=\"tp-cc-project-item-btn\">\r\n                                             <a href=\"#\">\r\n                                                Read more \r\n                                                <span>\r\n                                                   <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" fill=\"none\">\r\n                                                   <path d=\"M0.75 6.75H12.75M12.75 6.75L6.75 0.75M12.75 6.75L6.75 12.75\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\r\n                                                   </svg>\r\n                                                </span>\r\n                                             </a>\r\n                                          </div>\r\n                                       </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                 </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\r\n                                 <div class=\"tp-cc-project-item p-relative\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"tp-cc-project-item-thumb\">\r\n                                       <img class=\"radius-6\" src=\"/assets/img/corporate/project/thumb-2.jpg\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"tp-cc-project-item-box\">\r\n                                       <div class=\"tp-cc-project-item-content\">\r\n                                          <h3 class=\"tp-cc-project-item-title\">\r\n                                             <a href=\"#\">Differentiated performance</a>\r\n                                          </h3>\r\n                                          <p>Usability refers to the measurement of how easily br\r\n                                          and efficiently a user can accomplish their</p>\r\n                                          <div class=\"tp-cc-project-item-btn\">\r\n                                             <a href=\"#\">\r\n                                                Read more \r\n                                                <span>\r\n                                                   <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" fill=\"none\">\r\n                                                   <path d=\"M0.75 6.75H12.75M12.75 6.75L6.75 0.75M12.75 6.75L6.75 12.75\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\r\n                                                   </svg>\r\n                                                </span>\r\n                                             </a>\r\n                                          </div>\r\n                                       </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                 </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\r\n                                 <div class=\"tp-cc-project-item p-relative\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"tp-cc-project-item-thumb\">\r\n                                       <img class=\"radius-6\" src=\"/assets/img/corporate/project/thumb-3.jpg\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"tp-cc-project-item-box\">\r\n                                       <div class=\"tp-cc-project-item-content\">\r\n                                          <h3 class=\"tp-cc-project-item-title\">\r\n                                             <a href=\"#\">Innovation consultancy</a>\r\n                                          </h3>\r\n                                          <p>Usability refers to the measurement of how easily br\r\n                                          and efficiently a user can accomplish their</p>\r\n                                          <div class=\"tp-cc-project-item-btn\">\r\n                                             <a href=\"#\">\r\n                                                Read more \r\n                                                <span>\r\n                                                   <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" fill=\"none\">\r\n                                                   <path d=\"M0.75 6.75H12.75M12.75 6.75L6.75 0.75M12.75 6.75L6.75 12.75\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\r\n                                                   </svg>\r\n                                                </span>\r\n                                             </a>\r\n                                          </div>\r\n                                       </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                 </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                           </div>\r\n                           <div class=\"tp-cc-project-dot\"></div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                     </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n               </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n         <!-- project area end -->\r\n         \r\n\r\n      </main>";
